{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mosart_templates",
  "description": "Expression-template library for the MOSART river-routing component (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the pointwise flow laws and channel-geometry functions of mosart_physics.F90 (mosart1.1.13, cesm3.0-alphabranch checkout e59f2512), transcribed exactly for use by the hillslope / subnetwork / main-channel routing step components. The library carries (a) the Manning channel velocity v = (rr^2)^(1/3) sqrt(s) / n of CRVRMAN_nosqrt (mosart_physics.F90:406-422, including the rr <= 0 guard that zeroes the velocity), (b) the hillslope overland specific discharge eht = Gxr yh v of CREHT_nosqrt (F90:426-437), which calls the same Manning law, (c) the wetted cross-section area m = w/len of GRMR (F90:441-449), (d) the rectangular tributary depth m/twid and wetted perimeter twid + 2h of GRHT/GRPT (F90:453-481, with the TINYVALUE = 1.0e-14 dry-cell guards), (e) the hydraulic radius m/p of GRRR (F90:485-497), and (f) the three-part main-channel cross-section depth and wetted perimeter of GRHR/GRPR (F90:501-572): a rectangular bankfull section (width rwidth, depth rdepth), a trapezoidal flood-plain transition of slope SLOPE1 = 0.1, and a rectangular flood plain of width rwidth0; GRPR uses the exact Fortran constant 1/sin(atan(0.1)) (sinatanSLOPE1defr, F90:554). The Manning roughness n, nh, nt, nr are declared in the consuming components with their SI dimension s/m^(1/3) (the network file stores bare numbers; declaring the SI dimension keeps the equations dimensionally consistent: (rr^2)^(1/3) sqrt(s)/n has units m^(2/3)/(s/m^(1/3)) = m/s). All templates are match-less and invoked by name via apply_expression_template; the only shared-math dependency is overland_discharge -> manning_velocity (checked as an acyclic body-reference DAG at import, esm-spec 9.7.3). MOSART 1.1.13 has no tabulated (lookup-table) functions - all GR* geometry and the Manning law are analytic - so no function_tables entries are needed; Manning's n and the network geometry arrive as per-cell data from the frivinp network file (data source, pending stage-2.5). Reference: stage1/cesm/components/mosart/src/riverroute/mosart_physics.F90 (mosart1.1.13).",
   "tags": [
    "environmental_transport",
    "mosart",
    "river-routing",
    "hydrology",
    "expression-templates",
    "manning",
    "cesm"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-26T00:00:00Z",
   "authors": [
    "EqESM project contributors"
   ],
   "references": [
    {
     "citation": "Li, H., Wigmosta, M. S., Wu, H., Huang, M., Ke, Y., Coleman, A. M., and Leung, L. R. (2013). A physically based runoff routing model for land surface and earth system models. Journal of Hydrometeorology, 14(3), 808-828. The MOSART (Model for Scale Adaptive River Transport) routing scheme these components transcribe.",
     "doi": "10.1175/JHM-D-12-015.1"
    },
    {
     "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CESM, cesm3.0-alphabranch: MOSART river-routing source (mosart1.1.13) - mosart_physics.F90, mosart_driver.F90, mosart_tstatusflux_type.F90, mosart_tspatialunit_type.F90, rof_comp_nuopc/rof_import_export.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
     "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CESM"
    },
    {
     "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
     "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
    }
   ]
 },
 "expression_templates": {
  "manning_velocity": {
   "description": "Manning channel velocity CRVRMAN_nosqrt (mosart_physics.F90:406-422): v = ((rr*rr)^(1/3)) * sqrtslp / n, zeroed when the hydraulic radius rr <= 0 (the Fortran if/else). rr is the hydraulic radius [m], sqrtslp the sqrt of the bed slope [1], n the Manning roughness with its SI dimension s/m^(1/3).",
   "params": [
    "sqrtslp",
    "n",
    "rr"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "ifelse",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "<=",
      "args": [
       "rr",
       0.0
      ]
     },
     0.0,
     {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "^",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "^",
            "args": [
             "rr",
             2
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
             1,
             3
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         "sqrtslp"
        ]
       },
       "n"
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "overland_discharge": {
   "description": "Hillslope overland specific discharge CREHT_nosqrt (mosart_physics.F90:426-437): eht = Gxr * yh * CRVRMAN_nosqrt(sqrthslp, nh, yh) - the Manning velocity evaluated at the overland flow depth yh, scaled by the drainage density Gxr [1/m] and the depth. Shares the manning_velocity template by reference (the one shared-law factoring of the MOSART physics).",
   "params": [
    "sqrthslp",
    "nh",
    "Gxr",
    "yh"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "*",
    "args": [
     "Gxr",
     "yh",
     {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "manning_velocity",
      "bindings": {
       "sqrtslp": "sqrthslp",
       "n": "nh",
       "rr": "yh"
      }
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "wetted_area": {
   "description": "Wetted channel cross-section area GRMR (mosart_physics.F90:441-449): m = w / len, the storage w [m3] spread over the reach length len [m].",
   "params": [
    "w",
    "len"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "/",
    "args": [
     "w",
     "len"
    ]
   }
  },
  "rectangular_depth": {
   "description": "Tributary water depth GRHT (mosart_physics.F90:453-465) assuming a rectangular channel: h = m / twid, zeroed when the wetted area m <= TINYVALUE (1.0e-14, the Fortran module constant of F90:40).",
   "params": [
    "m",
    "twid"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "ifelse",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "<=",
      "args": [
       "m",
       1e-14
      ]
     },
     0.0,
     {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       "m",
       "twid"
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "rectangular_perimeter": {
   "description": "Tributary wetted perimeter GRPT (mosart_physics.F90:469-481) assuming a rectangular channel: p = twid + 2*h, zeroed when the depth h <= TINYVALUE (1.0e-14).",
   "params": [
    "h",
    "twid"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "ifelse",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "<=",
      "args": [
       "h",
       1e-14
      ]
     },
     0.0,
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       "twid",
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         2.0,
         "h"
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "hydraulic_radius": {
   "description": "Hydraulic radius GRRR (mosart_physics.F90:485-497): r = m / p (wetted area over wetted perimeter), zeroed when the perimeter p <= TINYVALUE (1.0e-14).",
   "params": [
    "m",
    "p"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "ifelse",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "<=",
      "args": [
       "p",
       1e-14
      ]
     },
     0.0,
     {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       "m",
       "p"
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "channel_depth": {
   "description": "Main-channel water depth GRHR (mosart_physics.F90:501-532) for the three-part cross section: a rectangular bankfull section of width rwidth and depth rdepth, a trapezoidal flood-plain transition of slope SLOPE1 = 0.1 (SLOPE1def, F90:41) rising from width rwidth to rwidth0 over height 0.1*((rwidth0-rwidth)/2), and a rectangular flood plain of width rwidth0. h = 0 when m <= TINYVALUE; h = m/rwidth when not flooded (m - rdepth*rwidth <= TINYVALUE); when the storage reaches the trapezoid h = rdepth + SLOPE1*((rwidth0-rwidth)/2) + deltam/rwidth0 with deltam = m - rdepth*rwidth - (rwidth+rwidth0)*SLOPE1*((rwidth0-rwidth)/2)/2; in the trapezoid itself h = rdepth + (-rwidth + sqrt(rwidth^2 + 4*deltam/SLOPE1))*SLOPE1/2 with deltam = m - rdepth*rwidth. TINYVALUE = 1.0e-14.",
   "params": [
    "m",
    "rwidth",
    "rwidth0",
    "rdepth"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "ifelse",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "<=",
      "args": [
       "m",
       1e-14
      ]
     },
     0.0,
     {
      "op": "ifelse",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "<=",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           "m",
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             "rdepth",
             "rwidth"
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         1e-14
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
         "m",
         "rwidth"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": ">",
          "args": [
           "m",
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               "rdepth",
               "rwidth"
              ]
             },
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                 "rwidth",
                 "rwidth0"
                ]
               },
               0.1,
               {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "/",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                     "rwidth0",
                     "rwidth"
                    ]
                   },
                   2.0
                  ]
                 },
                 2.0
                ]
               }
              ]
             },
             1e-14
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "rdepth",
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             0.1,
             {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                 "rwidth0",
                 "rwidth"
                ]
               },
               2.0
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
               "m",
               {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                   "rdepth",
                   "rwidth"
                  ]
                 },
                 {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                     "rwidth",
                     "rwidth0"
                    ]
                   },
                   0.1,
                   {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                     {
                      "op": "/",
                      "args": [
                       {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                         "rwidth0",
                         "rwidth"
                        ]
                       },
                       2.0
                      ]
                     },
                     2.0
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             },
             "rwidth0"
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
               "rwidth"
              ]
             },
             {
              "op": "sqrt",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "^",
                  "args": [
                   "rwidth",
                   2
                  ]
                 },
                 {
                  "op": "/",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                     4.0,
                     {
                      "op": "-",
                      "args": [
                       "m",
                       {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                         "rdepth",
                         "rwidth"
                        ]
                       }
                      ]
                     }
                    ]
                   },
                   0.1
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           0.1,
           {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
             2.0,
             1.0
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "channel_perimeter": {
   "description": "Main-channel wetted perimeter GRPR (mosart_physics.F90:536-572) for the same three-part cross section as channel_depth: p = 0 when h < TINYVALUE; p = rwidth + 2*h in the bankfull rectangle (h <= rdepth + TINYVALUE); in the flood plain p = rwidth + 2*(rdepth + ((rwidth0-rwidth)/2)*SLOPE1*sinatan + deltah) with deltah = h - rdepth - ((rwidth0-rwidth)/2)*SLOPE1; in the trapezoid p = rwidth + 2*(rdepth + (h - rdepth)*sinatan). sinatan is the Fortran sinatanSLOPE1defr = 1/sin(atan(SLOPE1def)) with SLOPE1def = 0.1, spelled here as the same expression (F90:554). TINYVALUE = 1.0e-14.",
   "params": [
    "h",
    "rwidth",
    "rwidth0",
    "rdepth"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "ifelse",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "<",
      "args": [
       "h",
       1e-14
      ]
     },
     0.0,
     {
      "op": "ifelse",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "<=",
        "args": [
         "h",
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "rdepth",
           1e-14
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         "rwidth",
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           2.0,
           "h"
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": ">",
          "args": [
           "h",
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             "rdepth",
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "-",
                  "args": [
                   "rwidth0",
                   "rwidth"
                  ]
                 },
                 2.0
                ]
               },
               0.1
              ]
             },
             1e-14
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "rwidth",
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             2.0,
             {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
               "rdepth",
               {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "/",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                     "rwidth0",
                     "rwidth"
                    ]
                   },
                   2.0
                  ]
                 },
                 0.1,
                 {
                  "op": "/",
                  "args": [
                   1.0,
                   {
                    "op": "sin",
                    "args": [
                     {
                      "op": "atan",
                      "args": [
                       0.1
                      ]
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               },
               {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                 "h",
                 {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                   "rdepth",
                   {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                     {
                      "op": "/",
                      "args": [
                       {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                         "rwidth0",
                         "rwidth"
                        ]
                       },
                       2.0
                      ]
                     },
                     0.1
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           "rwidth",
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             2.0,
             {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
               "rdepth",
               {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "-",
                  "args": [
                   "h",
                   "rdepth"
                  ]
                 },
                 {
                  "op": "/",
                  "args": [
                   1.0,
                   {
                    "op": "sin",
                    "args": [
                     {
                      "op": "atan",
                      "args": [
                       0.1
                      ]
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  }
 }
}
